  "description": "The capability to do great things\nGo anywhere and do everything with our most capable eMTB ever. Kado RSX's carbon fibre frameset, meticulously custom-tuned suspension, award-winning Total Geometry handling and low centre of gravity design aren't just for show: they deliver a highly capable and confidence-inspiring ride so you can tackle everything with total confidence. We've also carefully combined the finest trail-proven parts with Bosch's latest, powerfully refined and reliable CX motor, display and battery technologies. All to give you the power, control and range to take you - and your riding - further than ever before.\n\nHighlights\n– 160mm front + 150mm rear of custom-tuned suspension travel; equipped with Fox's latest 2027 Float 38 Performance Elite fork.\n– Uni-directional full carbon fibre frame with geometry adjustment is light and reassuringly strong.\n– Bosch's fifth generation Performance Line CX full-torque full-power motor with E-MTB+ mode + 120Nm torque + 750W peak power.\n– Bosch Kiox 400-C full-colour 2.0in top-tube display delivers a wealth of information at your fingertips.\n– 800Wh easily removeable, slide-in internal battery so you can ride further.\n– 29in trail-smoothing wheels front and rear + MX ready.\n– Optimised low centre of gravity gives you exceptional, confidence-inspiring handling.\n\nCharge time (800Wh): 50% in 2.3hrs from empty, and to 100% in 6.9hrs with 4A Charger.\n\nDiscover Kado>",
